Data Dictionary

FIPScode (numeric): County-level identifier
County (character): US County
State (character): US State
LungCancer (numeric): Lung cancer mortality (age-adjusted to the 2000 US standard population, per 100,000, see https://seer.cancer.gov/seerstat/tutorials/aarates/definition.html)
PM2.5 (numeric): Particulate matter under 2.5 µm in aerodynamic diameter (see EPA EQI report)
StatusVariable (binary): binary treatment indicator is the PM2.5 high (greater than 10.59 mg/m3) vs. low (less than 10.59 mg/m3)
LandEQI (numeric): Land quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
SociodEQI (numeric): Socio-demographic quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
BuiltEQI (numeric): Built environment quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
LTD (numeric): unclear
Intercept (numeric): unclear
Slope (numeric): unclear
CLU501 (numeric): unclear
PM10 (numeric): Particulate matter under 10 µm in aerodynamic diameter (see EPA EQI report)
SO2 (numeric): Sulfur dioxide (see EPA EQI report)
NO2 (numeric): Nitrogen dioxide (see EPA EQI report)
O3 (numeric): Ozone (see EPA EQI report)
CO (numeric): Carbon Monoxide (see EPA EQI report)
CN (numeric): unclear
Disel (numeric): Diesel engine emissions (see EPA EQI report)
CS2 (numeric): Carbon disulfide (see EPA EQI report)
AirEQI (numeric): Air quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
WaterEQI (numeric): Water quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
EQI (numeric): Overal environmental quality index, lower=better (see EPA EQI report)
